        <name>McElwain Elementary</name>
        <address>1020 Dawson Dr., Denver, CO 80229</address>
        <description><![CDATA[Workforce Area/Sub Area: Adams<br>Address: 1020 Dawson Dr., Denver, CO 80229<br>Program: Adams 14<br>Website: https://mcelwain.adams12.org/<br>Phone Number: 7209725500<br>Program Description: The Adult Learning Center in Adams 14 provides English Language Acquisition, Adult Basic Education, Adult Secondary Education, Family Literacy and preparation for the high school equivalency exams (GED, TASC and HiSET).  There are locations accessible to public transportation in Commerce City, Thornton and far northwest Denver.  Morning and evening classes available.<br>Services Available: Family Literacy.]]></description>
