        <description><![CDATA[Workforce Area/Sub Area: Adams<br>Address: 1537 Alton Street, Aurora, CO 80010, Room 220<br>Program: Asian Pacific Development Center<br>Website: https://www.apdc.org/<br>Phone Number: 3039232930<br>Program Description: APDC's Adult Education Program provides ESL, ABE/ASE, Citizenship, Computer and Job Readiness classes for adult learners.  Students can also utilize APDC's integrated care services and receive the support they need as they work towards self sufficiency.  This includes, but is not limited to, free babysitting, private tutoring, behavioral health care services, legal aid and more.<br>Services Available: Adult Basic Education, Adult Secondary Education/High School Equivalency, Integrated English Literacy and Civics Education, English Language Acquisition, Integrated Education and Training, Civics Education, Workforce Preparation, Financial Literacy, Parenting Classes, Computer Classes.]]></description>
